flowchart TD
    A[User opens NoteAI Lessons] --> B{Create note input}
    B -->|Typed text| C[Write lesson in note editor]
    B -->|Dictate Note| D[Browser Web Speech API writes speech into note]
    D --> C
    C --> E[JavaScript sends note to PHP api/notes.php]
    E --> F[PHP validates note title and content]
    F --> G[PHP calls Python NLP processor]
    G --> H[NLTK tokenization]
    G --> I[spaCy lemmatization]
    G --> J[NLTK VADER sentiment analysis]
    G --> K[spaCy keyword and entity processing]
    G --> L[Rule-based text classification]
    H --> M[Save note and NLP metadata to Supabase notes table]
    I --> M
    J --> M
    K --> M
    L --> M
    M --> N[Display saved note and NLP output]
    N --> O[User asks assistant a lesson question]
    O --> P[PHP api/chat.php analyzes question]
    P --> Q[Scan saved notes by keywords, lemmas, and content]
    Q --> R[Return matching lesson notes as answer]
    R --> S{Speak answer?}
    S -->|Yes| T[Browser Speech Synthesis API reads answer aloud]
    S -->|No| U[End interaction]
    T --> U
